{
  "_readme": [
    "Emoji sticker trigger map. Data, not source: add a concept here and the",
    "pipeline picks it up on the next render with no code change.",
    "",
    "Matching runs against Beat.caption_text tokens, because those are the",
    "tokens Beat.words carries timings for -- the Devanagari voice_text has a",
    "different word count and no timings at all. Devanagari aliases are still",
    "listed, for captions that mix scripts and in case captions_source is ever",
    "switched to voice_text.",
    "",
    "match:  aliases. A trailing * is a prefix match ('paisa*' hits paise,",
    "        paison). Everything is lowercased and stripped of punctuation",
    "        before comparison.",
    "weight: how strong a moment this is. When the per-video cap bites, the",
    "        highest weight wins. Keep the scale 1-10 and be stingy with 9s.",
    "search: terms the Lordicon catalogue is queried with when a human wants",
    "        to swap this trigger's art from the picker. The trigger's own",
    "        name is often a bad query (the catalogue has no icon called",
    "        'witness'), which is why these are listed separately."
  ],
